    "created_at": "2018-01-23T05:49:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-23T05:49:01Z",
    "body": "It’s probably less risky to expand the set Safari is shipping than reduce it.\r\n\r\nSafari’s choice of elements that inherit autocapitalize behavior is likely an artifact of implementation and not any kind of purposeful choice. But sadly mobile-centric sites sometimes come to depend on our quirks, even when it seems kind of improbable that they would. So we usually try to do some kind of testing before making changes.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
